            <ArticleTitle>[Acute coronary syndrome: modern approaches to diagnosis and treatment].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>24-9, 96</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Diseases of blood circulatory system for a long time are very widespread and stay being the main course of mortality in Russian Federation. The article presents a short review of methods of treatment in conditions of instable stenocardia and myocardial infarction, principles of theirs using and results of treatment in hospitals.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
